+# Proposal
+
+## Why
+
+Some clients send partial updates as JSON Merge Patch (RFC 7386), a simpler format than JSON Patch. The toolkit only supports RFC 6902 today.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `applyMergePatch(target, patch)`, implementing the RFC 7386 MergePatch algorithm, and export it from `src/index.ts`.
+- Document it in the README.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `json-merge-patch`: applying RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patches to JSON documents.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+New `src/json-merge-patch.ts`, a new export in `src/index.ts`, new tests, README section. No dependencies; existing behavior unchanged.
